OL,3,GNEWSADigital start-up centre to close
OL,4,
OL,5,FGuernsey's government-funded centre for
OL,6,Fdigital and creative start-ups is to
OL,7,Fclose, with the States looking for a
OL,8,Fprivate company to take it on.
OL,10,FThe Committee for Economic Development
OL,11,F(ED) launched a review of the Digital
OL,12,FGreenhouse last year, which led to the
OL,13,Finnovation board taking over
OL,14,Fresponsibility for the facility which
OL,15,Fopened in 2016.
OL,17,FThe Digital Greenhouse is used by
OL,18,Fbusinesses as a co-working space and
OL,19,Faccording to its website is "supporting
OL,20,Fthe growth of Guernsey's economy with a
OL,21,Ffocus on the digital and creative
OL,22,Fsectors".
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
